              </a>
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/girish-lade-075bba201/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon name="linkedin" class="w-4 h-4" /><span class="text-sm">LinkedIn</span>
